      "answer_index": 1,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp; \\text{由题意知，}\\zeta \\text{可取值}1,2,3,\\cdots, \\text{且}P\\{\\xi=k\\}=(1-0.25)^{k-1}\\times(0.25),\\ k=1,2,\\cdots,\\\\&amp; \\text{由于}f(x)=\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}kx^{k-1}=(\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}x^{k})^{t}=\\frac{1}{(1-x)^{2}},\\ \\text{故}E(\\zeta)=\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}(0.25)k(1-0.25)^{k-1}=4.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp; \\text{由题意知，}\\zeta \\text{可取值}1,2,3,\\cdots, \\text{且}P\\{\\xi=k\\}=(1-0.25)^{k-1}\\times(0.25),\\ k=1,2,\\cdots,\\\\&amp; \\text{由于}f(x)=\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}kx^{k-1}=(\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}x^{k})^{t}=\\frac{1}{(1-x)^{2}},\\ \\text{故}E(\\zeta)=\\sum_{k=1}^{\\infty}(0.25)k(1-0.25)^{k-1}=4.\\end{aligned}</div>"
