      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{设 } X_i \\text{ 表示第 } i \\text{ 次取得的号码，则 } X = \\sum_{i=1}^k X_i, \\text{ 且 } \\\\ P\\{X_i = m\\} = \\frac{1}{n}, \\\\ \\text{其中 } m = 1, 2, \\cdots, n, i = 1, 2, \\cdots, k, \\text{ 故 } \\\\ E(X_i) = \\frac{1}{n} (1 + 2 + \\cdots + n) = \\frac{n+1}{2}, i = 1, 2, \\cdots, k, \\\\ \\text{从而 } \\\\ E(X) = \\sum_{i=1}^k E(X_i) = \\frac{k(n+1)}{2}.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{设 } X_i \\text{ 表示第 } i \\text{ 次取得的号码，则 } X = \\sum_{i=1}^k X_i, \\text{ 且 } \\\\ P\\{X_i = m\\} = \\frac{1}{n}, \\\\ \\text{其中 } m = 1, 2, \\cdots, n, i = 1, 2, \\cdots, k, \\text{ 故 } \\\\ E(X_i) = \\frac{1}{n} (1 + 2 + \\cdots + n) = \\frac{n+1}{2}, i = 1, 2, \\cdots, k, \\\\ \\text{从而 } \\\\ E(X) = \\sum_{i=1}^k E(X_i) = \\frac{k(n+1)}{2}.\\end{aligned}</div>"
