      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{设 } X \\text{ 表示某人抽得奖金数（单位：元），则} \\\\ P\\{\\text{抽到的}3\\text{张均是}2\\text{元}\\} = P\\{X=6\\} = \\frac{C_8^3}{C_{10}^3} = \\frac{7}{15}\\,, \\\\ P\\{\\text{抽到的}3\\text{张有}2\\text{张是}2\\text{元}，\\text{一张是}5\\text{元}\\} = P\\{X=9\\} = \\frac{C_8^3 C_2^1}{C_{10}^1} = \\frac{7}{15}\\,, \\\\ P\\{\\text{抽到的}3\\text{张有}1\\text{张是}2\\text{元}，2\\text{张是}5\\text{元}\\} = P\\{X=12\\} = \\frac{C_1^1 C_2^2}{C_{10}^1} = \\frac{1}{15}\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{设 } X \\text{ 表示某人抽得奖金数（单位：元），则} \\\\ P\\{\\text{抽到的}3\\text{张均是}2\\text{元}\\} = P\\{X=6\\} = \\frac{C_8^3}{C_{10}^3} = \\frac{7}{15}\\,, \\\\ P\\{\\text{抽到的}3\\text{张有}2\\text{张是}2\\text{元}，\\text{一张是}5\\text{元}\\} = P\\{X=9\\} = \\frac{C_8^3 C_2^1}{C_{10}^1} = \\frac{7}{15}\\,, \\\\ P\\{\\text{抽到的}3\\text{张有}1\\text{张是}2\\text{元}，2\\text{张是}5\\text{元}\\} = P\\{X=12\\} = \\frac{C_1^1 C_2^2}{C_{10}^1} = \\frac{1}{15}\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>\n<span class=\"latex-text\">则 X 的分布律为</span>\n<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|} \\hline X &amp; 6 &amp; 9 &amp; 12 \\\\ \\hline  &amp; 7/15 &amp; 7/15 &amp; 1/15 \\\\ \\hline \\end{array}\">\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|} \\hline X &amp; 6 &amp; 9 &amp; 12 \\\\ \\hline  &amp; 7/15 &amp; 7/15 &amp; 1/15 \\\\ \\hline \\end{array}</div>\n<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\text{因此} E(X) = 6 \\times \\frac{7}{15} + 9 \\times \\frac{7}{15} + 12 \\times \\frac{1}{15} = 7.8（\\text{元}）.\">\\text{因此} E(X) = 6 \\times \\frac{7}{15} + 9 \\times \\frac{7}{15} + 12 \\times \\frac{1}{15} = 7.8（\\text{元}）.</span>"
