      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{因为每只球都有两种可能，故引入随机变量} \\\\ X_i = \\{ \\begin{array}{ll} 1, \\text{第}i\\text{号球进入第}i\\text{号盒} &amp; (i=1,2,\\cdots,n), \\\\ 0, &amp; \\text{反之} \\end{array} \\\\ \\text{因而，总配对数} X = \\sum_{i=1}^n X_i, \\text{于是} \\\\ E(X) = \\sum_{i=1}^n E(X_i), \\\\ E(X_i) = 1 \\cdot P\\{X_i = 1\\} = \\frac{1}{n} \\ (i=1,2,\\cdots,n), \\\\ \\text{故} \\\\ E(X) = \\sum_{i=1}^n \\frac{1}{n} = n \\cdot \\frac{1}{n} = 1.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{因为每只球都有两种可能，故引入随机变量} \\\\ X_i = \\{ \\begin{array}{ll} 1, \\text{第}i\\text{号球进入第}i\\text{号盒} &amp; (i=1,2,\\cdots,n), \\\\ 0, &amp; \\text{反之} \\end{array} \\\\ \\text{因而，总配对数} X = \\sum_{i=1}^n X_i, \\text{于是} \\\\ E(X) = \\sum_{i=1}^n E(X_i), \\\\ E(X_i) = 1 \\cdot P\\{X_i = 1\\} = \\frac{1}{n} \\ (i=1,2,\\cdots,n), \\\\ \\text{故} \\\\ E(X) = \\sum_{i=1}^n \\frac{1}{n} = n \\cdot \\frac{1}{n} = 1.\\end{aligned}</div>"
